OL,3,GNEWSASupport for plans to move
OL,4,Amaternity services
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost two-thirds of people who
OL,7,Fresponded to a public engagement
OL,8,Fexercise have backed proposals to move
OL,9,Fsome maternity services from Liverpool
OL,10,FWomen's Hospital to the Royal Liverpool
OL,11,FUniversity Hospital.
OL,13,FThe proposals aim to give high-risk
OL,14,Fpatients quicker access to intensive
OL,15,Fcare if needed, with about 150 births
OL,16,Fexpected to be affected each year.
OL,18,FAn online questionnaire on the future
OL,19,Fof maternity and gynaecology services
OL,20,Fin Liverpool was completed by 430
OL,21,Fpeople over six weeks earlier this
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
